# Backend (repo-root) Vercel project: only ship api/ + requirements.txt.
# Exclude pyproject.toml so Vercel installs from requirements.txt (lean + fastapi)
# instead of the package's full core deps (which omit fastapi and add ~120MB).
pyproject.toml
src
.venv
data
web
.git
docs
tests
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
.pytest_cache
*.egg-info
